WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.712
Underwater salient instance segmentation asks a
model to find and separate the most important objects in a scene,

00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:07.504
a foundational step for marine exploration and robotics.

00:00:07.584 --> 00:00:11.297
But it is hard.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:15.089
Underwater images suffer light scattering, color
distortion, and marine snow,

00:00:15.169 --> 00:00:18.881
so even top methods lose accuracy.

00:00:18.961 --> 00:00:22.673
The field has lacked a large-scale dataset with
pixel-level salient annotations,

00:00:22.753 --> 00:00:26.466
stalling progress.

00:00:26.546 --> 00:00:30.258
Foundation models like SAM exist,

00:00:30.338 --> 00:00:34.050
but were trained on natural images and struggle
underwater.
